	'k850e9d16' => 'Our farm letter is published four times a year to mark the natural turning of the farming seasons. In spring, we share stories of calving and the herd returning to open pasture. Summer brings news of haymaking and long evening barbecues under the walnut tree. Autumn covers the harvest from Rosa\'s kitchen garden and orchard fruit gathering, while winter offers reflections during our quiet maintenance rest. Each dispatch shares honest notes from Tomas, Noor, and Lukas on daily work with our 48 cows.',
