	'k88d0b0a3' => 'Makiba Farmstay is a working family dairy farm nestled along Weald Lane in Larkfield Valley, where seventy hectares of quiet green pasture meet the sky. The farm has been producing fresh milk since 1962, holding steady to gentle, traditional dairy practices across three generations of the Ferreira family.',
	'k89302eb6' => 'Stay',
	'k895210a8' => 'Mateo Ferreira',
	'k89fd4eb2' => 'notes from the barn, dairy and fields',
	'k8a0b3700' => 'STAY',
	'k8ce4e421' => 'Farm life moves according to five regular times, shaped by the needs of the dairy herd and the changing seasons. Guests of all ages are welcome to take part in daily work or simply watch the farm day unfold.',
	'k8e903bde' => 'Evening barbecue',
	'k8eba0a14' => 'Our communal evening barbecues take place on Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday evenings at 18:30 in the farmyard under the walnut tree. Cook Ama Owusu grills local meats, seasonal garden vegetables harvested by Rosa, and rustic accompaniments. Barbecues cost €22 for adults and €11 for children aged four to twelve. Please notify Ilse of any dietary preferences or food allergies when reserving your room so our kitchen can prepare.',
	'k8f36a10b' => 'Follow the rhythm of the herd from dawn milking to the evening barbecue under the walnut tree.',
